{
  "bodyHash": "R/YxD3PyUUM=",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/394/the_aether.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>總覽</strong></h2><p>此模組使天境與動態樹木相容，新增了由天境加入的所有樹木的動態生長版本，並在天境維度的世界生成過程中完全取代它們。<br>這些樹木的行為與生成可透過樹木包進行自訂與調整。</p><p>現已相容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">深層天境</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境重製版</a>！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特色</strong></h2><h4><strong>包含的樹木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>天根樹</li>\n<li>黃金橡樹</li>\n<li>水晶樹</li>\n<li>節慶樹（僅在12月與1月期間）</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>與深層天境相容的樹木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><strong>玫瑰根</strong></li>\n<li><strong>藍玫瑰根</strong></li>\n<li>雅格根</li>\n<li>粗根</li>\n<li>康莓</li>\n<li>日根</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>與天境重製版相容的樹木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><strong>鍍金橡樹</strong></li>\n<li><strong>凋零天根</strong></li>\n<li><strong>凋零柳</strong></li>\n<li><strong>原野根</strong></li>\n<li><strong>冰晶樹</strong></li>\n<li><strong>紫冰晶樹</strong></li>\n</ul><h4><strong>與古代天境相容的樹木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>附魔天根</li>\n<li>水晶天根</li>\n<li>櫻花樹</li>\n<li>天根松</li>\n<li>高根</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>與天境引力相容的樹木：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>附魔樹</li>\n<li>貝拉頓</li>\n<li>艾爾芬</li>\n<li>藍艾爾芬</li>\n<li>黃金艾爾芬</li>\n</ul><h4><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/387443/description_03b2584e-ad2f-4727-ab5b-7225d47f7416.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"307\"></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>來自深層天境的黃金林生態域</strong></em></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/387443/description_873cfb61-772b-46a4-ba11-a7f65c70aa56.png\" width=\"454\" height=\"237\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>來自天境重製版的原野根樹</strong></em></p><p><strong>世界生成：&nbsp;</strong></p><p>天境維度中的所有生態域現皆會生成動態樹木。<br>此功能可透過樹木包進行自訂。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他附加模組</strong></h2><p>適用於其他模組的動態樹木附加模組可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 動態樹木 CurseForge 頁面</a>找到。</p><h4><strong>建議與請求：</strong></h4><p>若要請求新增模組相容性，請在此提交！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需求</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a></li>\n</ul><h4>選用</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">深層天境</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境重製版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gravitation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境引力</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">古代天境</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>您可隨意將此模組用於任何模組包！無需詢問。<br>本模組採用 <strong>MIT</strong> 授權，其原始碼公開於 GitHub。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></h2>",
